HiTube Legacy — NOTICE
========================

HiTube Legacy is a redesign of SkyTube Legacy, giving it a fresh UI while
keeping all of its features and its compatibility with old Android devices.

Base project
------------
This application is based on:

  SkyTube Legacy
  https://github.com/SkyTubeTeam/SkyTubeLegacy
  by SkyTubeTeam and contributors
  License: GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0) — see the LICENSE file.

All credit for the original code, features and years of hard work goes to
the SkyTubeTeam and the SkyTube Legacy contributors. Without their work,
this project would not exist.

What changed in this redesign
-----------------------------
Only the user interface (UI) was redesigned — a fresh UI with a new, modern
look following modern Material 3 guidelines: a dark theme with a red accent,
clean surfaces, rounded thumbnails and cards, and a consistent type scale.

Nothing else changed:
  * All features work exactly as they did in SkyTube Legacy.
  * Compatibility with old Android is kept: minSdk 14 (Android 4.0+).
  * The application ID is unchanged: free.rm.skytube.legacy.
  * The display name is now "HiTube Legacy".

